: teleports the caster to the targeted cell or switches places with the target."},{"id":13862,"name":"Assistance","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_13162-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":7,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Teleports to the targeted cell"]},{"grade":2,"ap":2,"minRange":1,"maxRange":8,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"}],"buffs":["Teleports to the targeted cell"]}],"description":"Teleports the allied target to the first cell available between the caster and it. \nAlso heals the target if it is a Turret."},{"id":13834,"name":"Signal Box","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_13161-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":2,"minRange":0,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[],"buffs":["Attracts by 4 cell"]}],"description":"Attracts the target towards the nearest Turret in a 5-cell cross around it.\nIf the target ends its movement next to a Turret, that Turret teleports it symmetrically and reapplies the spell's effects on it."},{"id":13849,"name":"Breakwater","element":"neutral","is_variant":false,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_13295-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":1,"maxRange":6,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"}]},{"grade":2,"ap":3,"minRange":1,"maxRange":7,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":25,"max":0,"kind":"damage"}]}],"description":"Applies the Automatic state on a Turret and heals it:\n• The Turret intercepts close-combat damage suffered by allies adjacent to it when the spell is cast.\n• If one of those allies suffers ranged damage, the Turret activates, using its automatic spell on the ally or their attacker.\n\nThis activation can only be triggered once per target per turn, and only if the ally or attacker is within the Turret's range."},{"id":13876,"name":"Recursiveness","element":"neutral","is_variant":true,"image_url":"/data/spells/img/sort_12680-48.png","levels":[{"grade":1,"ap":3,"minRange":0,"maxRange":1,"maxPerTurn":0,"critChance":0,"effects":[{"element":"neutral","min":4,"max":4,"kind":"push"}]}],"description":"Repels the target.\nIf the target ends its movement next to a Turret, that Turret teleports it symmetrically and reapplies the spell's effects on it.\n\nThe initial pushback does not affect the caster."}]}